(7655443, 1246475, 59737, '<td valign="top">nicely captured and composed with some great pops of color, love the little water droplet.  The image looks slightly over-sharpened to me and there''s a good amount of sensor dust in the background that could have been cloned out</td>', 'nicely captured and composed with some great pops of color, love the little water droplet.  The image looks slightly over-sharpened to me and there''s a good amount of sensor dust in the background that could have been cloned out', '2020-03-15 08:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7655444, 1246484, 59737, '<td valign="top">To my eyes the better of the two tree frog photos, nicely composed with a good fall off of light and sharpness around the subject.  There''s some odd looking noise on the legs in and around the gap in the leaf.  I''d expect this to do well but also get a few down votes because it''s a style of photo that''s been seen many times before.</td>', 'To my eyes the better of the two tree frog photos, nicely composed with a good fall off of light and sharpness around the subject.  There''s some odd looking noise on the legs in and around the gap in the leaf.  I''d expect this to do well but also get a few down votes because it''s a style of photo that''s been seen many times before.', '2020-03-15 09:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7655445, 1246652, 59737, '<td valign="top">really like the seemingly simple nature of this, I enjoy abstracts and the play of light and shadow, sharp and out of focus and straight edges and curves really works well for me.  Wish that the highest peak was a little sharper.</td>', 'really like the seemingly simple nature of this, I enjoy abstracts and the play of light and shadow, sharp and out of focus and straight edges and curves really works well for me.  Wish that the highest peak was a little sharper.', '2020-03-15 09:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7655446, 1246675, 59737, '<td valign="top">Nice action image, the flow of the manes is great as is the positioning of the horses.  The fence in the background keeps drawing my eye and for me subtracts from the image.  Torn on color vs B&amp;W for this image, for this challenge think color is the right choice.</td>', 'Nice action image, the flow of the manes is great as is the positioning of the horses.  The fence in the background keeps drawing my eye and for me subtracts from the image.  Torn on color vs B&W for this image, for this challenge think color is the right choice.', '2020-03-15 09:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7655455, 1246671, 59737, '<td valign="top">love the simplicity of this, I see it symbolizing either hope or despair depending on how you look at it, an unreachable key or hope in an answer found, I personally prefer a tighter crop and probably would have taken some of the black from the top and bottom to tighten up the image</td>', 'love the simplicity of this, I see it symbolizing either hope or despair depending on how you look at it, an unreachable key or hope in an answer found, I personally prefer a tighter crop and probably would have taken some of the black from the top and bottom to tighten up the image', '2020-03-15 11:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7655456, 1246638, 59737, '<td valign="top">nice image, think if this was taken a little earlier with some color in the sky it would be a stronger image, a B&amp;W conversion and a tighter crop moving the tower to a third would have made this stronger for me given the black sky</td>', 'nice image, think if this was taken a little earlier with some color in the sky it would be a stronger image, a B&W conversion and a tighter crop moving the tower to a third would have made this stronger for me given the black sky', '2020-03-15 11:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7655458, 1246510, 59737, '<td valign="top">great photo, very cute tiger cub and a nice scene with the snow, nice fall off of focus as you move away from the eyes and muzzle area just like it should be</td>', 'great photo, very cute tiger cub and a nice scene with the snow, nice fall off of focus as you move away from the eyes and muzzle area just like it should be', '2020-03-15 12:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7655460, 1246654, 59737, '<td valign="top">very nicely done, great sharpness where it should be on the eyes, beak and fish.  I like the crop and how the negative space works on this and appreciate the challenge it must be to capture something in flight like this</td>', 'very nicely done, great sharpness where it should be on the eyes, beak and fish.  I like the crop and how the negative space works on this and appreciate the challenge it must be to capture something in flight like this', '2020-03-15 12:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
