(7655464, 1246516, 59737, '<td valign="top">like the location you shot this, definitely gives you a ton of options,  the processing choices make it feel somewhat artificial to me.  the processing choices do make the photo work well with the border, but I''m sure the border will rub people both ways</td>', 'like the location you shot this, definitely gives you a ton of options,  the processing choices make it feel somewhat artificial to me.  the processing choices do make the photo work well with the border, but I''m sure the border will rub people both ways', '2020-03-15 12:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7655465, 1246380, 59737, '<td valign="top">the shooting down angle doesn''t work well for me, I prefer to get down on the level of the animal for a more impacting photo, the dog and the overall photo is small which hurts the impact the photo could have</td>', 'the shooting down angle doesn''t work well for me, I prefer to get down on the level of the animal for a more impacting photo, the dog and the overall photo is small which hurts the impact the photo could have', '2020-03-15 12:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7655466, 1246469, 59737, '<td valign="top">nice PoV, the selective color works well to isolate the subject, guessing it would be much busier in full color</td>', 'nice PoV, the selective color works well to isolate the subject, guessing it would be much busier in full color', '2020-03-15 13:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7655467, 1246591, 59737, '<td valign="top">I never got into astrophotography, this is well done a nice clean sky no planes present and some interest in the foreground rock formations that were illuminated somehow.  The sky itself doesn''t have the pop I''ve seen on many of these images.  I think I would have cropped off the very top of the image.</td>', 'I never got into astrophotography, this is well done a nice clean sky no planes present and some interest in the foreground rock formations that were illuminated somehow.  The sky itself doesn''t have the pop I''ve seen on many of these images.  I think I would have cropped off the very top of the image.', '2020-03-15 13:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7655484, 1246475, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very sweet. I think this little beauty would have popped a bit more if you had eliminated the yellow cast throughout the image.</td>', 'Very sweet. I think this little beauty would have popped a bit more if you had eliminated the yellow cast throughout the image.', '2020-03-15 19:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
