(7655796, 1246450, 86447, '<td valign="top">This took me while... I hated it at first.  Then, a millisecond later, I was in love.<br/> <br/>I stared at it for a long while... enjoying the complex simplicity of it.<br/> <br/>I gave it an eight... ''cause you made me speak like a poet about it.  Ha!  <br/> <br/>I hope it does well for you!  ;)</td>', 'This took me while... I hated it at first.  Then, a millisecond later, I was in love. I stared at it for a long while... enjoying the complex simplicity of it. I gave it an eight... ''cause you made me speak like a poet about it.  Ha!   I hope it does well for you!  ;)', '2020-03-19 16:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
